message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the thesis What activation patching shows (Chapter 6, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24555440) and this repository."
title: "What single-position activation patches transfer in Qwen3 arithmetic: code and results"
abstract: "Tests what one patched residual-stream vector at one position transfers in two-step arithmetic in Qwen3-0.6B and Qwen3-4B-Instruct-2507: operands and output digits, rarely the intermediate result."
